/Title (The QMML Phase-2 assessment has been successfully completed, showcasing strong commitment and implementation of TQM practices across departments. A remarkable highlight of this phase was the intense competition between BRM2 & WRM2 and CRM1, both of which initially secured a tied top score. To determine the final winner, a re-assessment was conducted, following which BRM2 & WRM2 emerged as the winners of QMML Phase-2. The performance of BRM2 & WRM2 was commendable, with the team demonstrating excellent clarity and structure in presenting all required documents. A key highlight of their assessment was the active participation and involvement of team members at all levels, reflecting strong ownership and a deep-rooted TQM culture within the department. We also appreciate CRM1 for their outstanding effort and competitive performance. Congratulations to the winning team and appreciation to all departments for their continued efforts towards excellence in QMML implementation.)
